OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't do panto for the money, I
OL,4,Ado it because I care'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV presenter and actor Jonathan Wilkes
OL,7,Fhas been making Christmas audiences
OL,8,Flaugh, clap and cheer in pantomime at
OL,9,Fthe same theatre for two decades.
OL,11,FSince 2005, he has appeared in all but
OL,12,Fone of the festive shows staged at the
OL,13,FRegent Theatre in his home city of
OL,14,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,16,FAnd the 48-year-old, who launched
OL,17,FSoccer Aid with his long-term friend
OL,18,FRobbie Williams in 2006, is showing no
OL,19,Fsigns of stopping anytime soon.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
